New 4 Bedroom Apartment | 200 m² | Balconies | 300m from the Beach | 6th Floor | Póvoa de Varzim

Ready to Bookkeeping | Offer of the Deed of Sale*

More space, more comfort and the sea as the setting for your daily life.

This exclusive 4 bedroom flat, with 200 m² of gross area (155 m² usable), is located on the 6th floor of a modern development of high construction quality, just 300 meters from the beach, on one of the main avenues of Póvoa de Varzim.

With an excellent organisation of spaces, generous areas and three balconies, it offers a comfortable, bright and functional experience - ideal for families who value quality of life by the sea.

Property distribution:

- Cozy entrance hall;

- Large living room (30.75 m²), with living and dining area and access to the balcony;

- Kitchen (10.70 m²) in open space, fully equipped;

- Suite (14.20 m²) with private bathroom (2.25 m²);

- Bedroom (13.30 m²) with built-in wardrobe;

- Bedroom (9.00 m²), ideal for bedroom or office;

- Full bathroom (5.70 m²);

- Circulation area (5.30 m²), well distributed;

- 3 balconies, providing excellent luminosity and connection to the outside.

Equipment and finishes of excellence:

- Security door;

- Aluminum frames with double glazing;

- Thermal and electric blinds;

- Underfloor heating throughout the house;

- Pre-installation of air conditioning;

- False plasterboard ceilings with built-in LED lighting;

- Heat pump for water heating;

- Central vacuum system.

Other highlights:

- Garage space in the basement for one car;

- High energy efficiency;

- Modern construction with superior quality finishes.

Prime location:

Inserted in a central and valued area, close to commerce, services, schools and transport. A few minutes from the beach, it allows you to enjoy a lifestyle where urban comfort and proximity to the sea come together.

If you are looking for space, modernity and a premium location, this is the right property.

Schedule your visit now and discover your new home by the sea.

